    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "Lectures, in-class assignments and speeches. The emphasis is on the delivery of short, presentations. The topics will focus on real-life business and economic topics students may encounter in their future global market-place professional environment. The presentations will follow a standard format suggested by the instructor. The class will also include a TOEIC practice test as this test is often required by Taiwanese companies operating in an international and transnational business environment. \n講座、課堂作業和演講。 重點是提供簡短的演示文稿。 這些主題將側重於學生在未來的全球市場專業環境中可能遇到的現實生活中的商業和經濟主題。 演示文稿將遵循教師建議的標準格式。 該課程還將包括 TOEIC 實踐測試，因為在國際和跨國商業環境中運營的台灣公司通常需要進行此測試。\n\nMidterm 25%\nFinal 25%\nClasswork/assignments 50%",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "Lectures, in-class assignments and speeches. The emphasis is on the delivery of short, presentations. The topics will focus on real-life business and economic topics students may encounter in their future global market-place professional environment. The presentations will follow a standard format suggested by the instructor. The class will also include a TOEIC practice test as this test is often required by Taiwanese companies operating in an international and transnational business environment. \n講座、課堂作業和演講。 重點是提供簡短的演示文稿。 這些主題將側重於學生在未來的全球市場專業環境中可能遇到的現實生活中的商業和經濟主題。 演示文稿將遵循教師建議的標準格式。 該課程還將包括 TOEIC 實踐測試，因為在國際和跨國商業環境中運營的台灣公司通常需要進行此測試。\n\nMidterm 25%\nFinal 25%\nClasswork/assignments 50%",
